										"elType": "widget",
										"widgetType": "text-editor",
										"settings": {
											"editor": "<p>I trained as a typographer, spent six years in agencies in Rotterdam and London, and went independent in 2014. Since then I have worked with about seventy companies, from a two-person roastery to a national museum.</p><p>I like projects where the design has a job to do: a product that has to explain itself, a shop that has to be found, a book that has to be picked up. I am less useful when the brief is to look expensive.</p><p>I work alone by choice and in company when the job needs it. Over the years I have built a small circle of developers, writers, photographers and printers who know how I work.</p>"
